Note to future fixer (probably me 😆): It looks like [WebHostEnvironment.CopyPropertiesTo(IWebHostEnvironment destination)](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/e858e3dabbe8b9e0cbd8b6f57fcd7a5652984252/src/DefaultBuilder/src/WebHostEnvironment.cs#L79) needs to call [ResolveFileProviders](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/e858e3dabbe8b9e0cbd8b6f57fcd7a5652984252/src/DefaultBuilder/src/WebHostEnvironment.cs#L91) before copying over IFileProviders that maybe shouldn't be the NullFileProvider.

This way, code like the following should also work without referencing `builder.WebHost`:

```c#
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Builder;
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Hosting;

var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);
builder.Environment.WebRootPath = "www";
//...
```
